# The build context is the comagents root (build-image.sh); BuildKit reads this file because it sits next to
# Dockerfile. Only what the build stage copies goes in: agent-commons' and agent-orchestrator's sources, never
# target/, IDE files or the rest of the repository.
*
!agent-commons/pom.xml
!agent-commons/parent
!agent-commons/src
!agent-orchestrator/.mvn
!agent-orchestrator/mvnw
!agent-orchestrator/pom.xml
!agent-orchestrator/aot-*.properties
!agent-orchestrator/src
